From 5223fdbd0b8f40c0e682728c74ebebca9ff85d66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): preserve explicit rename partitions and bound
 reply aliases [daveey]

Placement aliases establish equivalence, not retirement direction. Preserve present partitions and fall back only to a unique equivalent after tombstones remove the old rows. Match exact author gateway components in all reply consumers.

Proof: seven overlap, delayed-map and sibling regressions fail on prior head; focused rename, sync, comment and wait suites pass. Add the disjoint warning-path control requested by independent review B3.
